# ARIA's AI keys. This file is private: it is in .gitignore and is never committed.
# Anything here overrides .env. Pick ONE option, remove the "# " in front of its three
# lines, paste your key, save, then restart the API.
# With every line commented out, ARIA keeps using the Groq key from .env.

# Option A: OpenAI (fast and reliable)
# ARIA_LLM_PROVIDER=openai
# ARIA_LLM_API_KEY=paste-your-openai-key-here
# LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# Option B: Gemini (fast; has a free tier)
# ARIA_LLM_PROVIDER=gemini
# ARIA_LLM_API_KEY=paste-your-gemini-key-here
# LLM_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash

# Voices (text-to-speech and the mic) still use GROQ_API_KEY from .env, so keep that set.
